# Input and State (Project Recipe)

## Movement state pattern

- Track direction and movement booleans.
- Start walk animation only when movement starts or direction changes.
- Return to idle animation when movement stops.

## Input prioritization

- Resolve directional input deterministically (project currently uses prioritized `if/else` order).
- Keep interaction locks explicit (`interacting` flag style).

## Object-local behavior

- Place update logic in `obj.onUpdate`.
- Keep shadow/auxiliary visual sync in same update loop.
- Avoid global handlers when behavior should pause with object lifecycle.
